+/*
+ * Trusted native producer only, on the QEMU display thread. The three
+ * descriptors must be read-only views of distinct, dedicated render targets.
+ * The producer reserves a slot before any GPU writes and implements
+ * take_latest using only GPU-completed frames. Normal guest blob resources
+ * and display primaries are ineligible. No raw guest FD enters this API.
+ *
+ * A successful attach owns duplicates of the descriptors and the callbacks
+ * until retire is invoked. The callback table must outlive that attachment.
+ * A release permits reuse of exactly the named lease. Retirement permanently
+ * ends writes into these objects; the UI may still have GPU reads in flight.
+ * Callbacks may not reenter the shared frame server.
